      a venomous claw strike upon all foes, dealing {0}% ATK damage. The poison seeps
      deep, afflicting enemies for {1}% ATK damage each round over {2} rounds. The
      Bear''s feral rage surges, increasing its ATK by {3}% and Crit by {4}% for
